Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm tired, but there's one piece of advice I must give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They tell me to give you some advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.42,0:00:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I see your fate as a line you needn't necessarily follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.52,0:00:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you do, you'll see how everything falls into place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.40,0:00:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather like a well-trodden path.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.50,0:00:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise you must cross a trackless jungle where nothing is easy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.59,0:00:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,yet just as beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.78,0:00:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So God arranged it when he gave us free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But the line I see now is tied to an image.
